 "message": "I haven't filed a production database request for Nina Patel (E014). Under POL-ACC-01, only an employee or their direct manager can file an access request for someone. The directory lists Nina's manager as Marcus Webb (E009), not you, so this request has to come from Marcus.\n\nNina is a full-time Engineering employee, so she is eligible for the production database under POL-ACC-02. Production database access is restricted, so once Marcus files it, Security approves it, which usually takes up to 3 business days. Nina starts 2026-11-23, so Marcus should file it soon to allow for approval.\n\nIf you think Marcus should not be the requester, the exception route in POL-ACC-02 is for the department head to email Security directly.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-ACC-01",
  "POL-ACC-02"
 ]
